# The Hugging Face build (Parquet). Removed from the repo on 2026-08-18.
#
# It was a second copy of the same 536 questions in a different format, and it drifted:
# built before cb1-06-public-0046 was marked unverifiable, never rebuilt, so the repo
# shipped two copies of that question disagreeing about its evidence tier. Nothing
# referenced the folder, and the builder that produces it is not in this repo, so it could
# not be regenerated here either.
#
# The Parquet distribution is the Hugging Face dataset itself
# (huggingface.co/datasets/cladbrain/cladbench), which is generated from src/cladbench/data/
# and is correct. One canonical copy in this repo, one published distribution — a format
# conversion checked in beside its own source will drift again.
cladbench-hf/
